* Integrator 1.620 V non-settling DIAGNOSIS deck (issue #92) -- ONE corner, local.
* NOT a performance claim and NOT a record: it is the single-corner probe that
* names the mechanism behind the 0/15 failures at Vdda = 1.620 V in
* sim/integrator-settling/record.json. Simulated (ngspice, transistor-level
* design/integrator + design/ota/ota_fd); nothing here is measured.
*
* Circuit, stimulus and timing are identical to integrator_settling_int1.cir
* (0.1 pF per-side load, case B) so the err_phase it reports is comparable to
* that bench; the difference is that this deck also saves internal node
* voltages and device operating points, which `run_settling.py --probe` cannot
* do and which it could not reach anyway (--probe is fixed at tt/27 C/1.8 V).
*
* run_diag.py substitutes the doubled-brace placeholders below: the PDK library
* and corner, the temperature and supply, the per-side load, the two .include
* paths, and the .control probe program. (They are not spelled out here: a
* literal placeholder inside this comment would itself be substituted.)
.lib {{PDK_LIB}} {{CORNER}}
.temp {{TEMP}}
.include {{OTA}}
.include {{NETLIST}}
Vdda vdda 0 {{VDDA}}
Vvcm vcm 0 0.9
Vrefp vrefp 0 1.5
Vrefn vrefn 0 0.3
Vinp vinp 0 1.2
Vinn vinn 0 0.6
Ibias vdda ibias 5u
Bphi1 phi1 0 V='v(vdda)*(1 - min(max((time-29.9n)/0.2n,0),1))'
Bphi1b phi1b 0 V='v(vdda) - v(phi1)'
Bphi1e phi1e 0 V='v(vdda)*(1 - min(max((time-27.9n)/0.2n,0),1))'
Bphi2 phi2 0 V='v(vdda)*min(max((time-34.9n)/0.2n,0),1)'
Bdn dn 0 V='v(vdda)'
Bdp dp 0 V='0'
* The instance line is built from the .subckt port list of the included
* netlist, not hard-coded, so this deck probes whichever port order the
* netlist declares (issue #92: `klt netlist` reorders ports by pin type).
{{XINT}}
Clp voutp 0 {{LOAD}}
Cln voutn 0 {{LOAD}}
* bench-only reset (not part of the cell): closes the OTA loop until 31 ns
Brst rst 0 V='1 - min(max((time-30.9n)/0.2n,0),1)'
Srp voutp xint.sump rst 0 swr
Srn voutn xint.sumn rst 0 swr
.model swr sw vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron=1 roff=1e15
Bvod vod 0 V='v(voutp)-v(voutn)'
{{PROBES}}
.end
